{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CH","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"歷代志上","commonName":"歷代志上","title":"歷代志上","order":13,"numberOfChapters":29,"sha256":"a668b4b6547e2ee24f3b6e74327236fef85ba56c9634c2dd8acf5b518e6a27b8","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":29,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/29.json","totalNumberOfVerses":939},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["約櫃遷出基列‧耶琳"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["大衛與千夫長、百夫長，就是一切首領商議。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["大衛對以色列全會眾說：「你們若以為美，見這事是出於耶和華－我們的上帝，我們就差遣人走遍以色列地，見我們未來的弟兄，又見住在有郊野之城的祭司利未人，使他們都到這裏來聚集。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我們要把上帝的約櫃運到我們這裏來；因為在掃羅年間，我們沒有在約櫃前求問上帝。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["全會眾都說可以如此行；這事在眾民眼中都看為好。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["於是，大衛將以色列人從埃及的西曷河直到哈馬口都招聚了來，要從基列‧耶琳將上帝的約櫃運來。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["大衛率領以色列眾人上到巴拉，就是屬猶大的基列‧耶琳，要從那裏將約櫃運來。這約櫃就是坐在二基路伯上耶和華上帝留名的約櫃。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他們將上帝的約櫃從亞比拿達的家裏抬出來，放在新車上。烏撒和亞希約趕車。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["大衛和以色列眾人在上帝前用琴、瑟、鑼、鼓、號作樂，極力跳舞歌唱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["到了基頓",{"noteId":11},"的禾場；因為牛失前蹄",{"noteId":12},"，烏撒就伸手扶住約櫃。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶和華向他發怒，因他伸手扶住約櫃擊殺他，他就死在上帝面前。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["大衛因耶和華擊殺",{"noteId":13},"烏撒，心裏愁煩，就稱那地方為毗列斯‧烏撒，直到今日。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["那日，大衛懼怕上帝，說：「上帝的約櫃怎可運到我這裏來？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["於是大衛不將約櫃運進大衛的城，卻運到迦特人俄別‧以東的家中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["上帝的約櫃在俄別‧以東家中三個月，耶和華賜福給俄別‧以東的家和他一切所有的。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":11,"caller":"-","text":"在撒母耳下六章六節是拿艮","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":9}},{"noteId":12,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：驚跳","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":9}},{"noteId":13,"caller":"-","text":"原文是闖殺","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/1CH/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}